From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Michals <tcmichals@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:35:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: pipeline: simple: Enable Software ISP for
 sun6i-csi

Enable the CPU Software ISP (Debayer + SoftIPA AGC/AWB) on the Allwinner
sun6i-csi pipeline so libcamera (`cam`) can produce both debayered RGB888
and raw Bayer streams on Allwinner A733/A523 CSI hardware.
---
 src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
index a03ddb6..84d8d59 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -264,7 +264,7 @@ static const SimplePipelineInfo supportedDevices[] = {
 	{ "mtk-seninf", { { "mtk-mdp", 3 } }, false },
 	{ "mxc-isi", {}, false },
 	{ "qcom-camss", {}, true },
-	{ "sun6i-csi", {}, false },
+	{ "sun6i-csi", {}, true },
 };
 
 bool isRaw(const StreamConfiguration &cfg)
-- 
